OL,3,GNEWSACemetery memorial rules agreed
OL,4,Aafter two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies will be allowed to have
OL,7,Fmemorial gardens on their loved ones'
OL,8,Fgraves after nearly two years of
OL,9,Fdebates with a Nottinghamshire council.
OL,11,FBroxtowe Borough Council faced protests
OL,12,Fafter ruling in July 2024 that
OL,13,Fadditional items on plots must be
OL,14,Fremoved at all five council-run
OL,15,Fcemeteries, citing maintenance and
OL,16,Fsafety issues.
OL,18,FBut the authority's cabinet has now
OL,19,Fapproved new regulations allowing for
OL,20,Fexisting memorial gardens of 3ft by 7ft
OL,21,F(0.91m x 2.1m) and new ones measuring
OL,22,F3ft by 3.3ft (0.91m x1m).
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
