OL,3,GNEWSACemetery memorial rules agreed
OL,4,Aafter two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, campaign group Friends
OL,7,Fof Broxtowe Cemeteries (FBC), said they
OL,8,Fbelieved the arrangements gave families
OL,9,F"flexibility in how they are able to
OL,10,Fexpress their grief at the graveside".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
